6,Morokodo - mgc (Nilo-Saharan) - PeopleGroups.org,https://peoplegroups.org/language/mgc/,"Morokodo (mgc) is part of the Nilo-Saharan family and Nilo-Saharan, Satellite-Core, Satellites, Central Sudanic, West, Bongo-Bagirmi, Bongo-Baka, Morokodo-Mo’da class.",Morokodo,Nilo-Saharan
7,Morokodo people,https://grokipedia.com/page/morokodo_people,"The Morokodo language belongs to the Central Sudanic branch of the Nilo-Saharan language family, specifically within the Bongo–Bagirmi group and the Bongo–Baka subgroup.",Morokodo,Nilo-Saharan
