9,AFRICA | 101 Last Tribes - Morokodo people,https://www.101lasttribes.com/tribes/morokodo.html,"They speak Morokodo language, a Nilo-Saharan language.Culture: Arts, Music, Literature and Handicraft. The culture of Moro Kodo is oral, reflecting virtue and high moral standards. It is expressed in songs, dance, music, folklore and other bodily expressions.",Morokodo,Nilo-Saharan
